This product contains Go translations of parts of the Kaldi speech
recognition toolkit (https://github.com/kaldi-asr/kaldi): feature
extraction, sliding-window CMN, compressed-matrix rounding, nnet3 x-vector
extraction, PLDA scoring and agglomerative clustering. Kaldi is copyright
the Kaldi authors and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product contains Go translations of the recipe and post-processing
scripts of bbc-speech-segmenter (https://github.com/bbc/bbc-speech-segmenter)
by Matt Haynes and Misa Ogura, BBC Research & Development, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. internal/diarize/vad-classifier.json holds the
parameters of its voice activity classifier, exported from
recipe/model/xvector-classifier.pkl.

internal/diarize/eigen.go contains an adapted copy of Dsyev and Dsteqr from
Gonum (https://github.com/gonum/gonum), copyright the Gonum Authors and
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause license, whose text is in that file.

At run time the program downloads the x-vector and PLDA model files that
bbc-speech-segmenter distributes (the DIHARD 2019 baseline x-vector model).
They are not part of this repository.
